1:# lib/algebra.mlpl -- finite algebraic structures as arrays.
3:# A finite binary operation on n elements IS an n x n Cayley table T, where
4:# T[a, b] is the index of a * b.  Every law in this repository is therefore an
5:# array predicate over T, checked without an explicit loop.
7:# Element identity is the index 0 .. n-1 throughout; human names live beside
8:# the table in a string list, never inside it.
10:# loops: 0
